00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:10.730
It's just a flip with a twist, right?

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:12.740
There's a lot more going on, but you

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:14.300
won't be able to absorb it the first

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:18.980
time you see it. Hi, savvy guy.

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:19.940
No Good. Okay.

