Oh, you were right. I totally missed it.

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:22.940
I'm glad.

00:00:22.940 --> 00:00:24.170
That happened. I'm actually glad that

00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:25.190
happened. It's a good reminder that

00:00:25.190 --> 00:00:26.900
Dunphy Tuck demands respect.

