00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:45.380
If I ever had to read braille, I'd--

00:00:46.040 --> 00:00:48.110
Oh, my God. I think I did it.

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:49.650
Did I do it? Almost.

00:00:49.670 --> 00:00:51.620
Yeah. Your form is a little off.

00:00:51.650 --> 00:00:53.240
Really? It felt perfect.

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:54.410
I'll try one more time.

00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:56.150
I'm not sure that's such a good idea.

00:00:56.180 --> 00:00:58.700
