00:01:08.660 --> 00:01:10.640
Oh, honey, you look exhausted.

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:11.570
Well, I am not.

00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:12.850
I am as strong as ever.

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:14.240
Certainly the strongest person in the

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:14.840
