00:01:15.290 --> 00:01:17.750
Is Luke doing the Dunphy tuck?

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:19.310
Sort of a poor man's version of it.

00:01:19.340 --> 00:01:21.380
Wow. He added a whole new twist.

00:01:21.410 --> 00:01:22.700
It's called over rotation.

00:01:22.700 --> 00:01:23.420
Look into it.

00:01:24.260 --> 00:01:25.580
I was so caught up in my spring

00:01:25.580 --> 00:01:26.990
cleaning, it took me a while to see

00:01:26.990 --> 00:01:29.180
