00:01:38.550 --> 00:01:39.810
Maybe I should take care of that.

00:01:40.080 --> 00:01:41.250
No, no, no.

00:01:41.250 --> 00:01:42.300
I can handle it.

00:01:42.300 --> 00:01:43.350
Looks pretty busy out there, not

00:01:43.350 --> 00:01:44.370
