00:01:45.630 --> 00:01:46.620
What are you doing?

00:01:46.650 --> 00:01:47.730
Last item on the list.

00:01:47.730 --> 00:01:48.470
Move the table.

00:01:48.480 --> 00:01:49.980
No, you should not be doing that alone.

00:01:49.980 --> 00:01:50.280
Really?

00:01:50.280 --> 00:01:51.330
Because I got the fridge out to the

00:01:51.330 --> 00:01:53.270
curb. How drug it Stand back.

00:01:53.280 --> 00:01:54.390
I'm turtling her. No, you're going to.

00:01:54.390 --> 00:01:55.460
Get hurt, sweetie. Let me get Luke.

00:01:55.470 --> 00:01:56.730
Luke, No, no, no, no, no. I don't need

00:01:56.730 --> 00:01:57.960
his help. Let him play his precious

00:01:57.960 --> 00:02:02.710
banjo. It's like the banjo was mocking

00:02:02.710 --> 00:02:06.340
me. You are not the man you used to be.

00:02:06.640 --> 00:02:08.350
You get up four times at night to pee,

00:02:08.350 --> 00:02:11.140
but to do your super duper old now.

00:02:12.610 --> 00:02:14.020
Hey, take five.

00:02:14.020 --> 00:02:15.040
I don't know that one.

00:02:15.070 --> 00:02:16.240
Give me a couple of minutes. I'll

00:02:16.240 --> 00:02:16.720
figure it out.

00:02:16.720 --> 00:02:18.100
It's a little hard to get things done

00:02:18.100 --> 00:02:19.270
