00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:20.500
What's that?

00:02:21.370 --> 00:02:25.090
Nothing. Is that a bra?

00:02:25.270 --> 00:02:26.620
You're not supposed to have girls up

00:02:26.620 --> 00:02:27.070
