00:02:27.070 --> 00:02:27.820
I can explain.

00:02:27.820 --> 00:02:28.990
You don't have to.

00:02:29.590 --> 00:02:31.150
You think you're an adult, but you're

00:02:31.150 --> 00:02:33.700
not. You're a kid living under my roof

00:02:33.700 --> 00:02:35.770
