00:02:40.180 --> 00:02:42.070
No, it hit my eye.

00:02:42.400 --> 00:02:43.000
Is it bleeding?

00:02:43.030 --> 00:02:44.470
First of all, eyes can't bleed.

00:02:44.470 --> 00:02:46.060
So. Sammy Davis Jr.

00:02:46.090 --> 00:02:48.310
That's bad. So the doctor will see you

00:02:48.310 --> 00:02:49.810
in a few minutes. Nice,

00:02:49.810 --> 00:02:51.040
someone can see.

00:02:51.460 --> 00:02:52.660
Glad to know your good eye can still

00:02:52.660 --> 00:02:55.700
roll. So still angry.

00:02:55.750 --> 00:02:55.900
Oh.

00:02:56.350 --> 00:02:57.820
Gee, why would I be angry?

00:02:57.820 --> 00:02:59.620
Because you insulted me, maimed me and

00:02:59.620 --> 00:03:01.120
belittled my achievements in the band.

00:03:01.120 --> 00:03:02.470
Johnny and Trampoline Arts.

00:03:02.800 --> 00:03:04.540
I'm sorry. I'm not proud of my behavior

00:03:04.540 --> 00:03:07.920
today. Probably started with the 5K I

00:03:07.920 --> 00:03:08.910
