00:03:08.940 --> 00:03:09.990
Ten K. For,

00:03:09.990 --> 00:03:11.190
everyone else.

00:03:11.910 --> 00:03:13.470
It's the first time in 15 years I

00:03:13.470 --> 00:03:14.520
couldn't finish.

00:03:15.280 --> 00:03:16.780
And today it's everything I can do.

00:03:16.810 --> 00:03:18.370
You can do better. No, I can't.

00:03:18.370 --> 00:03:19.540
Yes, you can.

00:03:19.570 --> 00:03:21.550
It's okay. It's not your fault.

00:03:23.300 --> 00:03:24.740
