00:03:29.430 --> 00:03:30.450
It's a shock.

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:33.020
Like when we first got high def TV and

00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:35.060
I realized that Bradley had an earring.

00:03:35.570 --> 00:03:37.310
I'm not as much of a man as you think,

00:03:37.310 --> 00:03:37.790
Dad.

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:39.080
Oh, really? How come?

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:41.390
An hour ago, I had a 16 year old girl's

00:03:41.390 --> 00:03:42.590
