00:04:36.140 --> 00:04:36.780
your son.

00:04:36.800 --> 00:04:37.490
I'm blind.

00:04:37.520 --> 00:04:38.460
Probably not.

00:04:38.480 --> 00:04:39.110
Luke Dunphy.

00:04:43.470 --> 00:04:44.820
I know I'm getting a little old for this

00:04:44.820 --> 00:04:47.760
place, but I do like coming here.

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:51.660
Oh, Lukey, you hurt your eye.

00:04:51.990 --> 00:04:53.310
Do you need a hug?

00:04:53.340 --> 00:04:54.540
A big one.

00:04:54.570 --> 00:04:55.020
Come here.

